    "message": "Link region water restorations to their outage events\n\nA water outage entered as an operational condition compiled a\nwater_restored event without causation_id. ScenarioSpec validation\nrequires the restoration to name its outage event, so every generated\nScenario with a water outage failed to build with a ValidationError.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
